{"n": 230, "w": 1000, "h": 760, "img": "230.webp", "text": "REAR AXLE 3 Series E 30 5 Series E 34 6 Serles E 24 7 Series E 32 8 Series E 31\n\n33 - 25\n\n33.63 . Coil Springs\n\nImportant!\n\nInstall only pairs of springs with same BMW number (located on end of spring) and same\ncolor code (either with or without stripe of red paint) on one axle.\n\nRefer to the parts microfiche for a survey of springs to vehicle type and, If applicable, special\nequipment (e.g. alr conditioner, sport suspension, etc.) as well as Introduction dates.\n\nThe BMW number on the spring can be used to determine the part number and therefore\nsprings on the parts microfiche belonging to a car.\n\nExample:\n\n1. Spring with red color code:\nnumber on spring, e.g. = 1 125 326\nadd 1 for part number = 1125 327\n\n2. Spring without red color code:\nnumber on spring, e.g. = 1 125 326\nadd 2 for part number = 1 125 328", "words": [["REAR", 0.0229, 0.0187, 0.061, 0.0321], ["AXLE", 0.0666, 0.0187, 0.1021, 0.0328], ["3", 0.3521, 0.0214, 0.3592, 0.0354], ["Series", 0.3643, 0.0214, 0.4055, 0.0354], ["E", 0.4116, 0.0214, 0.4192, 0.0354], ["30", 0.4248, 0.0214, 0.439, 0.0354], ["5", 0.4827, 0.0221, 0.4898, 0.0361], ["Series", 0.4949, 0.0214, 0.5356, 0.0361], ["E", 0.5417, 0.0221, 0.5493, 0.0354], ["34", 0.5549, 0.0221, 0.5691, 0.0361], ["6", 0.6128, 0.0221, 0.6199, 0.0354], ["Serles", 0.625, 0.0214, 0.6646, 0.0361], ["E", 0.6707, 0.0214, 0.6778, 0.0354], ["24", 0.6834, 0.0221, 0.6972, 0.0348], ["7", 0.7409, 0.0221, 0.747, 0.0348], ["Series", 0.753, 0.0214, 0.7927, 0.0354], ["E", 0.7988, 0.0214, 0.8064, 0.0348], ["32", 0.813, 0.0214, 0.8272, 0.0348], ["8", 0.872, 0.0214, 0.8786, 0.0341], ["Series", 0.8841, 0.0201, 0.9228, 0.0348], ["E", 0.9289, 0.0201, 0.936, 0.0334], ["31", 0.9421, 0.0201, 0.9548, 0.0334], ["33", 0.0234, 0.0602, 0.0666, 0.0749], ["-", 0.0417, 0.0575, 0.0483, 0.0822], ["25", 0.0539, 0.0602, 0.0666, 0.0749], ["33.63", 0.0213, 0.2032, 0.0554, 0.2172], [".", 0.0671, 0.2146, 0.0681, 0.2166]